           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo4-client/pull/31/files#r47974346",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "However, if the \"redundant\" call to ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "type": "code"
           }
          ],
          "text": "prependTransactionId()",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " within ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "type": "code"
           }
          ],
          "text": "getDatastream()",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " is necessary for transactions to work, then we should move this PR forward as is.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
